msgid "Moderators oversee the conduct rules. A contribution that breaks a conduct rule is not deleted but moved to the public <a href=\"%(value)s\">background page</a>, with the rule and the explanation. Spam or gross abuse is hidden completely. The author can object within seven days, and a moderator decides. Moderators can also close a conversation."
